        <mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading a relationship.&lt;/b&gt; Each end of a line describes the table it touches. For Customer and SalesOrder, the bar at the Customer end means each order has exactly one customer, and the circle with a crow&#x27;s foot at the SalesOrder end means each customer has zero or many orders." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="300" width="860" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
